  "summary": "聊天输入坞：左侧加号加附件，中间自适应高度输入框，右侧语音/发送随输入切换，附件以 chip 排在输入框上方。",
  "usage": "AI 对话/助手的输入区；需要同时支持文字、附件、语音，且发送按钮要随输入状态变化时用。",
  "caution": "单行搜索框别用它（过重）；移动端把附件/语音收进「+」二级菜单；附件超过 3 个折叠成「+N」，别把输入区顶高。",
  "hint": "点 + 加附件 · 输入文字后右侧从麦克风变成发送 · 点发送清空",
  "inspiration": "",
  "related": [],
  "prompt": "【AI 输入坞】目标：AI 对话输入区——左侧加号加附件、中间自适应高度输入框、右侧「语音 ↔ 发送」随输入状态切换；上传附件后输入框上方出现附件 chip 条。\n\n1) 结构：.dock（圆角 16px、padding 8px、宽 min(340px,100%)）> .files（附件 chip 条，空时 `:empty{display:none}`）+ .row（flex、align-items:flex-end）> .icon.add + .field（textarea）+ .right（30×30 相对定位，麦克风与发送两个按钮绝对定位叠在同一格）。\n2) 自适应高度：`ta.style.height='auto'` 后取 `ta.scrollHeight`，夹在 30–66px 之间再赋值；textarea 用 `resize:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:18px`。不要让它出现内部滚动条。\n3) 状态切换：`.dock.has-text .send` 变 `background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg)` 并发亮；`.dock.has-text .mic` 同时 `opacity:0;scale(.72);pointer-events:none`。两个按钮叠在同一格，宽度不跳；切换用 0.18 秒的 opacity/transform 过渡。\n4) 附件：chip = 文件 SVG + 文件名 + ×，`chip.animate` 从上往下 0.2 秒淡入；`.files:empty{display:none}` 保证没有附件时不留空白。\n5) 发送：只在有文字时生效（`if(!ta.value.trim()) return`），发送后清空文字与附件、回到麦克风态。\n6) 焦点：点输入框要 `ta.focus({preventScroll:true})`——**必须带 preventScroll**，否则 iframe 里的裸 focus 会把宿主页面滚到这张卡片。\n7) 坑：textarea 用 `height='auto'` 重算前要清掉旧 height，不然只能长不能缩；字体必须是 `font:inherit`（textarea 默认字体不同，宽度会溢出）；按钮用 SVG 不用 emoji；浅色主题下 .dock 底要 `color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg))`，直接用 --ui-surface 会和白底融为一体。\n8) 无障碍：textarea 有 aria-label；附件 × 有 aria-label；语音/发送是两个独立 button。\n9) 自动演示：300ms 后 __uiDemoCursor 点 +（560/190 毫秒）→ 加附件 → 点输入框 → 逐字打字（每字 48–88 毫秒）→ 发送按钮点亮 → 点发送清空 → cursor.hide() → 1.4 秒后重来。弹窗（__uiInteractive=true）里不启动定时器，用户可真实输入。\n10) 使用场景：AI 对话输入区，需要文字 + 附件 + 语音多入口时。单行搜索框不要用。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);background:radial-gradient(720px 400px at 78% -12%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 10%,transparent),transparent 62%),var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:22px;overflow:hidden}\nsvg{display:block;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.dock{width:min(340px,100%);border-radius:16px;padding:8px;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);box-shadow:0 8px 24px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n.files{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-bottom:7px}\n.files:empty{display:none}\n.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:24px;padding:0 4px 0 6px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10.5px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text);max-width:100%}\n.chip svg{width:11px;height:11px;stroke-width:1.7;color:var(--ui-text-dim);flex:0 0 auto}\n.chip span{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n.chip .fdel{flex:0 0 auto;width:15px;height:15px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:none;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-size:11px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer}\n.chip .fdel:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:7px}\n.icon{flex:0 0 auto;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease,transform .1s ease}\n.icon:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.icon svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke-width:1.9}\n.icon.pressing{transform:scale(.92)}\n.field{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;transition:transform .1s ease}\n.field.pressing{transform:scale(.99)}\ntextarea{display:block;width:100%;height:30px;min-height:30px;max-height:66px;resize:none;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:12.5px;line-height:18px;padding:6px 2px;overflow:hidden}\ntextarea::placeholder{color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.right{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;width:30px;height:30px}\n.right .btn{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .18s ease,background .18s ease}\n.right .btn svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke-width:2}\n.mic{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.send{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.dock.has-text .send{background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg)}\n.dock.has-text .mic{opacity:0;transform:scale(.72);pointer-events:none}\n.dock.has-text .send{opacity:1;transform:none}\n.dock:not(.has-text) .send{opacity:0;transform:scale(.72);pointer-events:none}\n.right .btn.pressing{transform:scale(.9)}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .icon,.field,.right .btn{transition:none}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:8px}\n  .dock{padding:7px}\n  textarea{font-size:12px;line-height:17px;max-height:51px}\n  .icon,.right,.right .btn{width:28px;height:28px}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"dock\" id=\"dock\">\n  <div class=\"files\" id=\"files\"></div>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <button class=\"icon add\" id=\"add\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"添加附件\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5.5v13M5.5 12h13\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"field\" id=\"field\">\n      <textarea id=\"ta\" rows=\"1\" placeholder=\"给 AI 发消息…\" aria-label=\"消息内容\"></textarea>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <button class=\"btn mic\" id=\"mic\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"开始语音输入\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5 2.5v5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-5 0V7A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5z\"/><path d=\"M6.5 11.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 11 0\"/><path d=\"M12 17v2.6\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"btn send\" id=\"send\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"发送\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19.5V6\"/><path d=\"M6.6 11.4L12 6l5.4 5.4\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var dock=document.getElementById('dock'),\n      files=document.getElementById('files'),\n      ta=document.getElementById('ta'),\n      field=document.getElementById('field'),\n      addBtn=document.getElementById('add'),\n      micBtn=document.getElementById('mic'),\n      sendBtn=document.getElementById('send');\n  var FILE_SVG='<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h6l5 5v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-10a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><path d=\"M12.5 3.5V9h5\"/></svg>';\n\n  function syncState(){\n    dock.classList.toggle('has-text', ta.value.trim().length>0);\n  }\n  function autoGrow(){\n    ta.style.height='auto';\n    ta.style.height=Math.max(30, Math.min(ta.scrollHeight, 66))+'px';\n  }\n  function addFile(){\n    if(files.children.length) return;\n    var chip=document.createElement('div');\n    chip.className='chip';\n    chip.innerHTML=FILE_SVG+'<span>设计规范.pdf</span>';\n    var del=document.createElement('button');\n    del.className='fdel';\n    del.type='button';\n    del.setAttribute('aria-label','移除附件');\n    del.textContent='×';\n    del.addEventListener('click',function(){ chip.remove(); syncState(); });\n    chip.appendChild(del);\n    files.appendChild(chip);\n    chip.animate([{opacity:0,transform:'translateY(-6px) scale(.96)'},{opacity:1,transform:'none'}],{duration:200,easing:'ease-out'});\n    syncState();\n  }\n  function resetAll(){\n    ta.value='';\n    files.innerHTML='';\n    autoGrow();\n    syncState();\n  }\n  function sendMessage(){\n    if(!ta.value.trim()) return;\n    resetAll();\n  }\n\n  ta.addEventListener('input',function(){ syncState(); autoGrow(); });\n  addBtn.addEventListener('click',addFile);\n  sendBtn.addEventListener('click',sendMessage);\n  micBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){});\n\n  var cursor=null, timer=0;\n\n  function press(target,pressingEl,after){\n    cursor.press();\n    pressingEl.classList.add('pressing');\n    timer=setTimeout(function(){\n      cursor.release();\n      pressingEl.classList.remove('pressing');\n      after();\n    },190);\n  }\n  function clickEl(el,pressingEl,after){\n    cursor.moveTo(el);\n    timer=setTimeout(function(){ press(el,pressingEl,after); },560);\n  }\n  function typeText(text,done){\n    var i=0;\n    (function step(){\n      if(i>=text.length){ done(); return; }\n      i++;\n      ta.value=text.slice(0,i);\n      syncState();\n      autoGrow();\n      timer=setTimeout(step,48+Math.random()*40);\n    })();\n  }\n  function cycle(){\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    resetAll();\n    var r=dock.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width||!r.height){ timer=setTimeout(cycle,300); return; }\n    if(!cursor&&typeof window.__uiDemoCursor==='function') cursor=window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    if(!cursor){ addFile(); return; }\n    if(cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show');\n    clickEl(addBtn,addBtn,function(){\n      addFile();\n      timer=setTimeout(function(){\n        clickEl(ta,field,function(){\n          ta.focus({preventScroll:true});\n          typeText('帮我总结这份规范的重点',function(){\n            timer=setTimeout(function(){\n              clickEl(sendBtn,sendBtn,function(){\n                sendMessage();\n                timer=setTimeout(function(){\n                  cursor.hide();\n                  timer=setTimeout(cycle,1400);\n                },1500);\n              });\n            },520);\n          });\n        });\n      },520);\n    });\n  }\n\n  resetAll();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive){ timer=setTimeout(cycle,300); }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
